{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40221","headline":"长安雪後 · 喻坦之","name":"长安雪後","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧落云收尽，天涯雪霁时。\n草开当井地，树折带巢枝。\n野渡滋寒麦，高泉涨禁池。\n遥分丹阙出，回对上林宜。\n宿片攀檐取，凝花就砌窥。\n气凌禽翅束，冻入马蹄危。\n北想连沙漠，南思极海涯。\n冷光兼素彩，向暮朔风吹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"喻坦之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40221.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40221","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}